nnr0\">Puedes conocer en detalle todo lo que incluye X-Ray en el </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>blog oficial de anuncios</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">:</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">👉 </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://stellar.org/blog/developers/stellar-x-ray-protocol-25-upgrade-guide?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">https://stellar.org/blog/developers/stellar-x-ray-protocol-25-upgrade-guide</a></span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"color:#0f0f0f;font-family:__inter_2ff36d, __inter_Fallback_2ff36d, sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight:400;--font-size:16px;--mobile-font-size:inherit\">Puedes leer todo sobre lo que incluye X-Ray en el </span></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://stellar.org/blog/developers/announcing-stellar-x-ray-protocol-25\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\" style=\"--wt-inline-link-underline-color-override:#ffffff;--wt-inline-link-color-override:#ffffff\"><span style=\"color:#0f0f0f;font-family:inherit, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight:inherit;--font-size:16inherit;--mobile-font-size:inherit\"><u style=\"text-decoration:underline\">blog de anuncios</u></span></a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"color:#0f0f0f;font-family:__inter_2ff36d, __inter_Fallback_2ff36d, sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight:400;--font-size:16px;--mobile-font-size:inherit\"> y mantenerte al día sobre todos los anuncios relacionados con X-Ray en el </span></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/stellardev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\" style=\"--wt-inline-link-underline-color-override:inherit;--wt-inline-link-color-override:inherit\"><span style=\"color:#0f0f0f;font-family:inherit, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight:inherit;--font-size:16inherit;--mobile-font-size:inherit\"><u style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Discord de Desarrolladores de Stellar</u></span></a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"color:#0f0f0f;font-family:__inter_2ff36d, __inter_Fallback_2ff36d, sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight:400;--font-size:16px;--mobile-font-size:inherit\">, donde el ecosistema coordina y comparte información sobre la actualización.</span></span></p></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"fechas-clave\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Fechas clave</span></h2></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>15 de diciembre de 2025</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> — Versiones estables disponibles</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>7 de enero de 2026, 21:00 UTC</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> — Actualización de Testnet</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>22 de enero de 2026, 17:00 UTC</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> — Votación de actualización de Mainnet</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-blockquoteFigure yuqx90\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"dream-post-content-blockquoteFigure yuqx93\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"dream-post-content-quote _1xtprv91\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"_1xtprv92\">❝</div><div class=\"_1xtprv90\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Importante:</strong></span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Este ciclo de lanzamiento ocurre durante el período festivo, por lo que hay más tiempo del habitual entre la disponibilidad de las versiones estables y la actualización de Testnet.</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Las nuevas versiones son compatibles con el protocolo actual, por lo que puedes actualizar el software tan pronto como estén disponibles.</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Si no puedes hacerlo antes de finalizar 2025, se recomienda planificar la actualización durante la </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>primera semana de enero de 2026</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"qu-necesitas-hacer-para-prepararte\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Qué necesitas hacer para prepararte?</span></h2></div><div id=\"si-usas-un-sdk-de-stellar\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Si usas un SDK de Stellar</span></h3></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Testnet:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> actualiza a la última versión del SDK correspondiente antes del </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>7 de enero de 2026</strong></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Mainnet:</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> actualiza a la última versión de los SDKs relevantes antes del </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>22 de enero de 2026</strong></span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">📚 Documentación de SDKs:</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">👉 </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://developers.stellar.org/docs/tools/sdks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">https://developers.stellar.org/docs/tools/sdks</a></span></p></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"si-operas-infraestructura-de-stella\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Si operas infraestructura de Stellar</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">(Stellar Core, Horizon, RPC o Galexie)</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Instala las versiones correspondientes al </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Protocolo 25</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Si utilizas </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Docker</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, descarga las imágenes del Protocolo 25 desde el registro oficial</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Si compilas desde código fuente o usas paquetes Debian, asegúrate de actualizar los binarios de:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><code>stellar-core</code></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><code>stellar-horizon</code></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><code>stellar-rpc</code></span></p></div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div id=\"consideraciones-por-sistema-operati\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Consideraciones por sistema operativo</span></h2></div><div id=\"ubuntu\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Ubuntu</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Se ha publicado las imágenes para </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://apt.stellar.org/pool/stable/s/stellar-core/stellar-core_25.0.0-2911.e9748b05a.noble_amd64.deb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\" style=\"--wt-inline-link-underline-color-override:inherit;--wt-inline-link-color-override:inherit\"><span style=\"color:#0f0f0f;font-family:inherit, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight:inherit;--font-size:16inherit;--mobile-font-size:inherit\"><u style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Ubuntu 24.04</u></span></a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> y </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://apt.stellar.org/pool/stable/s/stellar-core/stellar-core_25.0.0-2911.e9748b05a.jammy_amd64.deb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\" style=\"--wt-inline-link-underline-color-override:inherit;--wt-inline-link-color-override:inherit\"><span style=\"color:#0f0f0f;font-family:inherit, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight:inherit;--font-size:16inherit;--mobile-font-size:inherit\"><u style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Ubuntu 22.04</u></span></a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">. Para construir desde el código fuente puedes referirte a las </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://github.com/stellar/stellar-core/blob/master/INSTALL.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\" style=\"--wt-inline-link-underline-color-override:inherit;--wt-inline-link-color-override:inherit\"><span style=\"color:#0f0f0f;font-family:inherit, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight:inherit;--font-size:16inherit;--mobile-font-size:inherit\"><u style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Instrucciones de Instalación</u></span></a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> para los pasos de instalación.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\" style=\"--text-align:left\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Hemos descontinuado Ubuntu 20.04 (focal). Los operadores en Ubuntu 20.04 necesitarán actualizar su SO a 24.04 o 22.04. También hemos cambiado a llvm-20. Los operadores que usen Ubuntu 22.04 necesitarán agregar los repositorios de llvm-20 a sus sistemas para instalar los nuevos paquetes. Este paso no será necesario en Ubuntu 24.04. Ve los detalles en las </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://github.com/stellar/stellar-core/blob/master/INSTALL.md#ubuntu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\" style=\"--wt-inline-link-underline-color-override:inherit;--wt-inline-link-color-override:inherit\"><span style=\"color:#0f0f0f;font-family:inherit, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight:inherit;--font-size:16inherit;--mobile-font-size:inherit\"><u style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Instrucciones de Instalación de Ubuntu</u></span></a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">. La instalación basada en paquetes también se describe en la documentación de Stellar </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://developers.stellar.org/docs/validators/admin-guide/installation#package-based-installation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\" style=\"--wt-inline-link-underline-color-override:inherit;--wt-inline-link-color-override:inherit\"><span style=\"color:#0f0f0f;font-family:inherit, system-ui, sans-serif;font-weight:inherit;--font-size:16inherit;--mobile-font-size:inherit\"><u style=\"text-decoration:underline\">documentación</u></span></a></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div><div id=\"docker\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:400;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:inherit\"><strong>Docker</strong></span></span></h3></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:400;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:inherit\">Imagen oficial de </span></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:400;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:inherit\">Stellar Core para Protocolo 25</span></strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:400;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:inherit\"> ya publicada</span></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:400;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:inherit\">Instalación y uso documentados en la documentación oficial de Stellar</span></span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🐳</span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit;font-weight:400;--font-size:100%;--mobile-font-size:inherit\"> Guía Docker:</span></span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><span style=\"font-f